On Sun, 2004-02-29 at 23:14, Park Lee wrote:
> Hi,
> Would you please tell me whether the Type Enforcement model using in
> SELinux derived directly from the Domain and Type Enforcement model?

No.  The SELinux TE model is described in the report available from
http://www.nsa.gov/selinux/papers/policy2-abs.cfm.  A brief comparison
of SELinux and DTE is in the related work sections of the published
papers.  I also have a fairly detailed comparison of SELinux/Flask vs.
DTE that I can send you if you are really interested.

